  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following is NOT a type of sector classification according to this chapter?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Primary, Secondary, Tertiary"},{"id":"b","text":"Public, Private"},{"id":"c","text":"Organised, Unorganised"},{"id":"d","text":"Agricultural, Industrial"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why is it important to discuss the problems in the unorganised sector during class discussions?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To highlight its importance in GDP calculations"},{"id":"b","text":"To understand why government intervention is necessary"},{"id":"c","text":"To show examples of how technology can be used more effectively"},{"id":"d","text":"To explain how it contributes to employment statistics"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What do Gross Value Added (GVA) data mainly help in understanding?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The total output of the economy"},{"id":"b","text":"Changes in prices over time"},{"id":"c","text":"Distribution of income across sectors"},{"id":"d","text":"Level of employment in different industries"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role does NSSO play in the field of Economic Statistics?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Collecting data on employment and unemployment"},{"id":"b","text":"Designing economic models for forecasting"},{"id":"c","text":"Analyzing GDP figures for the country"},{"id":"d","text":"Deciding fiscal policies based on data"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why is it significant to study and understand the services sector of an economy?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It forms a large portion of GDP in developed economies"},{"id":"b","text":"It includes all types of businesses regardless of size or organization"},{"id":"c","text":"It directly impacts daily lives through consumption goods"},{"id":"d","text":"It is the only sector that contributes positively to employment rates"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What distinguishes the Public Sector from Private Sector in terms of employment?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Public Sector offers more flexible working hours"},{"id":"b","text":"Public Sector provides higher wages and benefits"},{"id":"c","text":"Private Sector is less regulated by government laws"},{"id":"d","text":"Public Sector generally hires fewer people compared to private companies"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement best describes the unorganised sector in India?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It includes all informal businesses and workers without formal contracts"},{"id":"b","text":"It primarily consists of large multinational corporations"},{"id":"c","text":"It represents a significant part of the government workforce"},{"id":"d","text":"It is characterized by high-tech manufacturing industries"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does GVA data contribute to economic planning and policy-making?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By showing how much money people earn from their jobs"},{"id":"b","text":"By revealing the overall output of an economy in real terms at basic prices for industry of origin"},{"id":"c","text":"By indicating the unemployment rate across different sectors"},{"id":"d","text":"By determining how much government spending impacts GDP growth"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What impact does the decline of agriculture have on the economy's employment?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It leads to a decrease in agricultural output, but increases employment in other sectors"},{"id":"b","text":"It causes an increase in unemployment as it employs fewer people than other sectors"},{"id":"c","text":"It shifts more people into the unorganised sector where conditions are often worse"},{"id":"d","text":"It has no significant impact on overall employment statistics"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the organised sector differ from the unorganised sector in terms of business practices?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Organised sectors operate without any government regulations"},{"id":"b","text":"Organised sectors are usually more formal with contracts and laws guiding operations"},{"id":"c","text":"Unorganised sectors provide better wages to their employees"},{"id":"d","text":"The unorganised sector is always larger than the organised sector in terms of employment numbers"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which scenario best illustrates a problem within the Unorganised Sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"A factory that implements advanced machinery and processes"},{"id":"b","text":"A shop selling goods with no official registration or taxes paid"},{"id":"c","text":"An automobile manufacturer exporting to various countries"},{"id":"d","text":"A tech startup receiving venture capital funding for rapid growth"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why is it important for students to understand the concept of GVA at basic prices?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It allows them to calculate personal income taxes accurately"},{"id":"b","text":"It helps in understanding the difference between GDP and unemployment rates"},{"id":"c","text":"It aids in evaluating the economic performance of sectors by accounting for input costs"},{"id":"d","text":"It is useful for predicting stock market trends"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What type of employment data would be most relevant to analyze when discussing unemployment in the unorganised sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Gross Domestic Product (GDP) growth figures"},{"id":"b","text":"Unemployment statistics from NSSO surveys conducted annually"},{"id":"c","text":"Economic development indicators like per capita income"},{"id":"d","text":"Exports and Imports data for trade balance analysis"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the unorganised sector contribute to India's economy?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It is the primary source of employment for skilled workers"},{"id":"b","text":"It provides services that are difficult or impossible to replace by organised sectors"},{"id":"c","text":"It generates significant tax revenues for the government"},{"id":"d","text":"It drives technological innovation and new business models"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role does NSSO play in gathering employment data?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They provide guidelines on how to conduct surveys efficiently"},{"id":"b","text":"They directly employ workers for the survey process"},{"id":"c","text":"They analyze and publish employment statistics for national use"},{"id":"d","text":"They design the questionnaires used in NSSO surveys"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does it mean if an economy's Gross Value Added (GVA) is increasing?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The government has increased its spending"},{"id":"b","text":"There is a rise in prices, indicating inflation"},{"id":"c","text":"Value of goods and services produced by the economy has risen"},{"id":"d","text":"Economic growth is negative as it indicates a decrease in output"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement best represents the role of NSSO in policy-making?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They provide data for public relations campaigns by the government"},{"id":"b","text":"They make decisions on fiscal and monetary policies directly"},{"id":"c","text":"They analyze economic data to support policy recommendations"},{"id":"d","text":"They create economic models that predict market trends"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In 1977-78, which sector was most likely to be engaged in primary production activities?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Tertiary Sector"},{"id":"b","text":"Secondary Sector"},{"id":"c","text":"Primary Sector"},{"id":"d","text":"Manufacturing Sector"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What significant change does the graph indicate has occurred between 1977-78 and 2017-18?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Increase in Agricultural Production"},{"id":"b","text":"Decrease in Primary Sector Production"},{"id":"c","text":"Increase in Tertiary Sector Production"},{"id":"d","text":"No Change in Total Production"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does the tertiary sector's production increase indicate economic growth?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Because of improved agricultural productivity"},{"id":"b","text":"Due to better manufacturing and industrial performance"},{"id":"c","text":"From enhanced services such as healthcare, education, and transport"},{"id":"d","text":"By reducing primary sector activities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$If India's GDP was around 20 trillion in 2017-18, what could be inferred about the economy?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It is showing steady growth over time"},{"id":"b","text":"The tertiary sector alone contributed to GDP growth"},{"id":"c","text":"Agriculture and industry have declined significantly"},{"id":"d","text":"Services like healthcare are declining in importance"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement best explains the rise of the Tertiary Sector in India?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It is diminishing because agriculture has grown more rapidly'"},{"id":"b","text":"Services emerged as dominant due to industrial and agricultural growth'"},{"id":"c","text":"The tertiary sector's production decreased"},{"id":"d","text":"All services are declining, focusing on primary and secondary sectors"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What could be a plausible reason for the significant increase in Tertiary Sector Production?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Improved efficiency in manufacturing processes'"},{"id":"b","text":"Enhanced service provision such as healthcare and education'"},{"id":"c","text":"Increased focus on primary production activities'"},{"id":"d","text":"Decreased government spending on infrastructure"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following services is least likely to be considered part of the Tertiary Sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Health Care Services'"},{"id":"b","text":"Postal Services'"},{"id":"c","text":"Agricultural Machinery Manufacturing'"},{"id":"d","text":"Banking and Financial Institutions"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How would a comparison between 1977-78 and 2017-18 for GDP be interpreted?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The economy has stagnated over this period'"},{"id":"b","text":"Agriculture and Industry have seen steady growth, while services increased'"},{"id":"c","text":"There was a shift from agriculture to industry, with services growing the most'"},{"id":"d","text":"Services declined in importance as primary sectors expanded"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What could be inferred about India's economic composition in 1977-78 compared to 2017-18?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The economy shifted from agriculture and industry to services'"},{"id":"b","text":"Services like healthcare are dominant, overshadowing agriculture and manufacturing'"},{"id":"c","text":"Primary production remains the backbone of India's economy'"},{"id":"d","text":"Industry is declining in importance as service-based sectors grow"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How might increased Tertiary Sector Production affect employment?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"More jobs are created in primary and secondary industries'"},{"id":"b","text":"Employment growth primarily occurs in the tertiary sector'"},{"id":"c","text":"Secondary sector employment decreases as it is replaced by the tertiary sector'"},{"id":"d","text":"There's no change in employment across sectors"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does a significant rise in Tertiary Sector Production imply about economic development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It suggests that agriculture and industry are declining in importance'"},{"id":"b","text":"Services such as healthcare, education, and transportation have become more vital'"},{"id":"c","text":"The economy is becoming less diversified'"},{"id":"d","text":"There's a return to traditional economic activities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following statements best reflects the role of Tertiary Sector Production in India’s GDP?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It represents only non-economic sectors such as health and education'"},{"id":"b","text":"Services are significant contributors, reflecting industrial growth'"},{"id":"c","text":"The tertiary sector is diminishing due to a shift towards agriculture and industry'"},{"id":"d","text":"Tertiary Sector Production does not influence GDP calculations"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How would the tertiary sector's importance in India’s economy affect government policy?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The government should reduce spending on basic services like healthcare and education'"},{"id":"b","text":"Investment in infrastructure for agricultural growth is necessary'"},{"id":"c","text":"Services such as banking, insurance, and transport need to be prioritized'"},{"id":"d","text":"There’s no change needed in the current allocation of resources"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does a comparison between Tertiary Sector Production in 1977-78 and 2017-18 indicate about economic development?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The tertiary sector has seen stagnant growth'"},{"id":"b","text":"Services have become more important as primary sectors grew'"},{"id":"c","text":"Primary production has overtaken the importance of the tertiary sector'"},{"id":"d","text":"Industry is declining in importance, leading to decreased GDP"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
