  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which economic activity can provide employment for those who cannot afford agricultural equipment and need to sell their produce locally?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Opening cold storage facilities"},{"id":"b","text":"Setting up a dal mill for processing pulses"},{"id":"c","text":"Establishing honey collection centers in forest areas"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What economic sector is suggested as an opportunity for farmers near forests to improve their livelihoods?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Honey collection from wild bees"},{"id":"b","text":"Setting up vegetable processing units"},{"id":"c","text":"Starting small IT businesses"},{"id":"d","text":"Opening cold storage facilities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why might setting up a dal mill in semi-rural areas be beneficial for farmers growing pulses like arhar and chickpea?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It allows farmers to access credit from local banks"},{"id":"b","text":"It enables farmers to process their own produce reducing the need for middlemen"},{"id":"c","text":"It ensures higher prices for their produce when sold through this facility"},{"id":"d","text":"It provides employment opportunities only for women in rural areas"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role does transportation play in increasing employment within the agricultural sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It helps reduce underemployment by transporting goods directly to urban markets"},{"id":"b","text":"It leads to increased job losses as fewer people need to transport their own products"},{"id":"c","text":"It has no significant impact on employment levels"},{"id":"d","text":"It exclusively benefits large agribusiness corporations"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How can the education sector address underemployment in rural areas, according to the study by NITI Aayog?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By creating jobs for teachers and other staff required in schools"},{"id":"b","text":"By reducing the number of educational institutions to save costs"},{"id":"c","text":"By offering free textbooks to all students in rural areas"},{"id":"d","text":"By increasing the number of children who drop out of school to reduce overcrowding"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which measure could help improve healthcare services for farmers living in remote villages?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Building more hospitals and clinics in urban centers"},{"id":"b","text":"Increasing the number of doctors, nurses, and health workers in rural areas"},{"id":"c","text":"Offering free medical treatments to all villagers"},{"id":"d","text":"Reducing taxes on pharmaceutical companies"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role does tourism play in addressing employment issues in regional economies?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It can create jobs for local guides and service providers"},{"id":"b","text":"It leads to the closure of traditional industries like farming"},{"id":"c","text":"It increases demand for imported goods rather than local products"},{"id":"d","text":"It decreases the need for infrastructure development in rural areas"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which type of industry is suggested as a potential area for job creation by NITI Aayog's study?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Tourism-based services like hotels and restaurants"},{"id":"b","text":"Advanced manufacturing sectors requiring high-tech equipment"},{"id":"c","text":"Small-scale agricultural processing units in rural areas"},{"id":"d","text":"E-commerce platforms serving urban markets only"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What problem related to child labor can be addressed by improving access to schools?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Improving the quality of education available to children"},{"id":"b","text":"Reducing the number of hours children spend at school"},{"id":"c","text":"Increasing the age range for compulsory schooling laws"},{"id":"d","text":"Ensuring that all households have enough income to send their children to school"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How can setting up a honey collection center in forest areas contribute to employment generation?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By creating jobs for beekeepers and local collectors of wild honey"},{"id":"b","text":"By reducing the need for traditional food sources like crops or livestock"},{"id":"c","text":"By providing raw materials for pharmaceutical companies"},{"id":"d","text":"By eliminating competition from imported honey"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In what way does MGNREGA 2005 aim to improve employment opportunities in rural areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By ensuring every farmer receives government subsidies automatically"},{"id":"b","text":"By guaranteeing work for those who are willing and able to do so under the programme"},{"id":"c","text":"By mandating a fixed number of hours of work per month"},{"id":"d","text":"By requiring all farmers to sell their produce through state-run markets"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role does irrigation play in enhancing agricultural productivity?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It enables cultivation of crops that were previously not possible due to water scarcity"},{"id":"b","text":"It decreases the need for agricultural credit and storage facilities"},{"id":"c","text":"It ensures a higher yield from existing farms without any other changes needed"},{"id":"d","text":"It primarily benefits large commercial farms over smaller ones"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which aspect of development is NOT discussed in relation to employment generation in Chapter 1?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Improving healthcare and education services access for rural areas"},{"id":"b","text":"Increasing tourism activities to generate jobs"},{"id":"c","text":"Expanding agricultural production without considering market demand"},{"id":"d","text":"Creating new service industries in semi-rural areas"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a potential drawback of setting up small IT businesses in villages near forest areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It may lead to overpopulation and resource depletion"},{"id":"b","text":"It can result in an increase in unemployment for local farmers"},{"id":"c","text":"There could be insufficient demand for their products or services"},{"id":"d","text":"Local communities might resist the change due to unfamiliarity with technology"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does transportation affect employment within the agricultural sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Transportation has no impact on employment levels in agriculture"},{"id":"b","text":"Improved transportation can reduce underemployment by making it easier for farmers to sell their products"},{"id":"c","text":"It exclusively benefits urban-based industries and jobs"},{"id":"d","text":"Increased transportation costs always lead to decreased agricultural productivity"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is the main challenge faced by a poor farmer like Laxmi in accessing credit?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Lack of proper documentation required for loan applications"},{"id":"b","text":"The reluctance of banks or financial institutions to provide credit at reasonable rates"},{"id":"c","text":"Too many farmers competing for limited resources"},{"id":"d","text":"Insufficient demand from the agricultural sector for loans"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How can setting up a dal mill in rural areas specifically help small-scale farmers?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It increases their dependency on middlemen who buy raw materials at low prices"},{"id":"b","text":"It allows them to process and sell their produce locally, reducing transportation costs and risks"},{"id":"c","text":"It leads to an increase in the price of their products due to centralized processing facilities"},{"id":"d","text":"It requires farmers to sell their entire harvest to the mill for it to be profitable"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is one benefit of honey collection centers established near forest areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It ensures a steady supply of raw materials for the local population only"},{"id":"b","text":"It provides an alternative source of income for rural families not dependent on agriculture"},{"id":"c","text":"It decreases biodiversity by introducing non-native bee species"},{"id":"d","text":"It increases the dependency on imported honey products"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which group is most likely to benefit from the establishment of cold storage facilities in villages?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Small-scale farmers who primarily sell their produce directly to consumers"},{"id":"b","text":"Large commercial agricultural enterprises that need long-term storage solutions"},{"id":"c","text":"Urban-based businesses looking for raw materials"},{"id":"d","text":"Government agencies responsible for regulating food quality"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is the primary role of MGNREGA in addressing employment issues within rural areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It provides a fixed number of days' work per month to all willing and able adults"},{"id":"b","text":"It mandates that all villagers use government-provided transportation services"},{"id":"c","text":"It guarantees employment opportunities for farmers regardless of their willingness or ability to work"},{"id":"d","text":"It encourages the privatization of agricultural practices within rural communities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does irrigation contribute to enhancing agricultural productivity in semi-rural areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By allowing cultivation of crops that are traditionally not possible due to water scarcity"},{"id":"b","text":"It ensures a higher yield from existing farms without any other changes needed"},{"id":"c","text":"It primarily benefits large commercial farms over smaller ones"},{"id":"d","text":"It reduces the need for agricultural credit and storage facilities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is NOT mentioned as an advantage of setting up small IT businesses in villages near forest areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Creation of employment opportunities for local youth"},{"id":"b","text":"Encouragement of traditional farming practices by displacing other sources of income"},{"id":"c","text":"Potential to increase rural incomes through new services and products"},{"id":"d","text":"Reduced need for government subsidies or support from financial institutions"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How can the establishment of cold storage facilities in villages affect transportation within agricultural systems?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It reduces transportation costs by storing produce closer to consumers"},{"id":"b","text":"It increases transportation costs due to higher demand for storage services"},{"id":"c","text":"It has no impact on transportation costs or methods"},{"id":"d","text":"It decreases the variety of crops that can be grown and sold locally"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a potential negative consequence of tourism as a sector in rural areas according to NITI Aayog's study?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Increased competition from large urban-based businesses"},{"id":"b","text":"Higher taxes on local residents leading to economic strain"},{"id":"c","text":"Decreased demand for traditional cultural products and services"},{"id":"d","text":"Overcrowding and environmental degradation due to rapid growth"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How can education improve employment opportunities in rural areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By increasing the number of students who drop out of school"},{"id":"b","text":"Reducing the need for agricultural practices by creating off-farm job opportunities"},{"id":"c","text":"It ensures that all villagers have access to the same level of education regardless of their economic status"},{"id":"d","text":"Providing knowledge and skills that can lead to better-paying jobs or new service industry opportunities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a potential limitation of setting up small IT businesses in villages near forest areas?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Limited availability of raw materials for production"},{"id":"b","text":"Insufficient local demand for their services or products"},{"id":"c","text":"The need for large initial investments that may not be available locally"},{"id":"d","text":"Difficulty in accessing modern technology due to limited infrastructure"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta and Kamal have different employment statuses mainly due to$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The difference in their educational backgrounds."},{"id":"b","text":"Whether they work in an organised or unorganised sector."},{"id":"c","text":"The amount of time they spend at work each day."},{"id":"d","text":"Their preference for urban or rural areas."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta's employment is characterized by$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Irregular hours and no guaranteed job security."},{"id":"b","text":"Fixed working hours with benefits such as medical aid and pensions."},{"id":"c","text":"Working from home on a freelance basis."},{"id":"d","text":"A lack of any rules or regulations governing employment."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta's situation differs significantly from Kamal’s due to$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The nature of work in her sector being seasonal and unpredictable."},{"id":"b","text":"Her working alongside others rather than independently."},{"id":"c","text":"Having a formal contract with the employer she works for."},{"id":"d","text":"Not having any form of leave or holidays as benefits."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement best describes the difference between Kanta and Kamal’s situations?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal has a fixed working schedule with regular pay, unlike Kanta who works variable hours without any guarantees of employment."},{"id":"b","text":"Kanta's job provides benefits such as medical care and pensions, whereas Kamal does not receive such perks."},{"id":"c","text":"Both have guaranteed jobs but differ in the amount of leave they are entitled to."},{"id":"d","text":"Neither has access to any form of benefits or security due to their employment status."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta’s job offers her$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Flexible working hours with no guaranteed employment."},{"id":"b","text":"Pension and medical benefits as a part of regular employment."},{"id":"c","text":"Unpredictable work schedules without any formal contracts or guarantees."},{"id":"d","text":"No form of leave or holidays, only paid for the days worked."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What distinguishes Kanta's employment from Kamal’s?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal is not entitled to any leave and his work hours are irregular."},{"id":"b","text":"Kanta has a formal contract with her employer, while Kamal does not have one."},{"id":"c","text":"The unorganised sector where Kanta works provides more benefits compared to the organised sector where Kamal works."},{"id":"d","text":"Kamal’s employment is secure and guaranteed by law, unlike Kanta who may be asked to leave at any time due to employer discretion."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In the context of employment security, which statement best reflects a difference between organised and unorganised sectors?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Organised sector workers have fixed working hours with guaranteed employment, while those in the unorganised sector work without any formal contracts."},{"id":"b","text":"Unorganised sector workers receive higher wages compared to their counterparts in the organised sector."},{"id":"c","text":"Organised sector employees are not entitled to leave or holidays, unlike those in the unorganised sector who often have them."},{"id":"d","text":"Employment in the organised sector is more secure and benefits such as leave and pensions are guaranteed, while employment in the unorganised sector does not offer these assurances."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kamal’s situation reflects$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The benefits and security of employment provided by formal contracts in the organised sector."},{"id":"b","text":"A lack of any form of benefits or guarantees for employment, leading to potential job loss at employer discretion."},{"id":"c","text":"Regulated working hours with fixed wages, similar to Kanta’s experience."},{"id":"d","text":"The unpredictability and irregularity of work in the organised sector compared to the unorganised sector."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta’s employment is characterized by$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Unpredictable working hours without any formal contracts or guarantees."},{"id":"b","text":"Fixed working hours with benefits such as medical aid and pensions, regulated by laws like the Factories Act."},{"id":"c","text":"Employment through informal agreements where she has no contract but is paid regularly."},{"id":"d","text":"Irregular work schedules without any legal protection or benefits."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta's employment situation differs from Kamal’s due to$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The formal contracts and regulated working conditions in the organised sector compared to the unorganised sector where employment is informal and less secure."},{"id":"b","text":"The nature of work being seasonal for Kanta compared to fixed hours for Kamal."},{"id":"c","text":"Kamal's lack of any form of leave or holidays, which is provided by law in the organised sector but not in the unorganised sector."},{"id":"d","text":"The absence of any benefits such as medical aid and pensions in the organised sector."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement accurately describes a difference between Kanta's and Kamal’s employment status?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kanta works under formal contracts with guaranteed job security, while Kamal does not have any formal agreements and is vulnerable to being asked to leave at the employer's discretion."},{"id":"b","text":"Kamal receives medical benefits as part of his employment package in contrast to Kanta who only gets a provident fund allowance."},{"id":"c","text":"Both work in organised sectors but Kamal’s job provides more benefits such as paid leaves and pensions, unlike Kanta’s which does not offer these."},{"id":"d","text":"Kamal's employment is secure with guaranteed wages, while Kanta works under informal arrangements without any formal contracts or guarantees of employment."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which characteristic best differentiates Kamal’s work situation from that of organised sector workers?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal has a fixed salary and benefits such as medical aid, unlike the irregular and unpaid nature of his work in the unorganised sector."},{"id":"b","text":"The unorganised sector employs fewer people compared to the organised sector."},{"id":"c","text":"Organised sector workers are not entitled to leave or holidays, only Kamal receives them."},{"id":"d","text":"Kamal's job provides him with all forms of benefits and guarantees of employment which Kanta does not have."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The difference in the level of security between Kanta’s and Kamal’s jobs is mainly due to$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal's work as a daily wage labourer has no contract or guarantee, whereas Kanta's employment status ensures her job security."},{"id":"b","text":"Kanta receives benefits like medical aid and pensions which are not available to Kamal."},{"id":"c","text":"Organised sector workers have fewer leave days than those in the unorganised sector."},{"id":"d","text":"The organised sector employees work with informal contracts, while those in the unorganised sector do not have any formal agreements or guarantees of employment."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kanta’s job provides benefits such as medical aid and pensions because$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"She is an employee in the organised sector who has a contract with her employer, unlike Kamal who does not have any formal agreement or guarantees of employment."},{"id":"b","text":"Organised sector workers are employed by companies which provide them with these benefits due to their formal contracts and regulated working conditions."},{"id":"c","text":"Kamal is paid irregularly without any form of contract, so he cannot receive such benefits."},{"id":"d","text":"Unorganised sector workers are usually not entitled to any benefits or guarantees of employment, hence Kanta's situation differs from Kamal’s."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kamal’s work situation is marked by which of the following?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Fixed working hours and guaranteed wages are provided by his employer in contrast to the irregular nature of his employment without any formal contracts or guarantees of employment."},{"id":"b","text":"Benefits such as medical aid and pensions are not available to Kamal due to his informal work status, while Kanta receives these benefits as she is in an organised sector with a formal contract."},{"id":"c","text":"Kamal's job does not offer any form of leave or holidays, unlike the regulated working conditions in the organised sector which provide such perks."},{"id":"d","text":"Organised sector workers are paid based on their performance and have no guarantees of employment, while unorganised sector workers receive fixed wages as per their contract with their employers."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement accurately reflects the difference in Kanta's employment status compared to Kamal’s?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal works under informal agreements without any formal contracts or benefits, while Kanta has a contract and regular wages."},{"id":"b","text":"Organised sector workers are provided with more benefits such as medical aid and pensions due to their regulated working conditions, unlike the unorganised sector where employment is informal and less secure."},{"id":"c","text":"Kamal's work provides him with all forms of benefits and guarantees of employment which Kanta does not have."},{"id":"d","text":"Both employees receive regular wages but Kamal has no formal agreement or guarantees of employment, unlike Kanta who works under a formal contract and receives benefits such as medical aid and pensions."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kamal's situation differs from Kanta’s due to$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The presence of fixed working hours and guaranteed employment in the organised sector, unlike his irregular work schedule without any formal contracts or guarantees in the unorganised sector."},{"id":"b","text":"Organised sector workers are not entitled to leave or holidays, while those in the unorganised sector often have them."},{"id":"c","text":"Kanta’s job provides benefits such as medical aid and pensions which Kamal does not receive due to his work status in the unorganised sector without any formal agreements or guarantees of employment."},{"id":"d","text":"Both employees have similar levels of security but different working conditions, with Kanta having more flexibility in her hours and Kanta receiving all forms of benefits including medical aid and pensions."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement correctly describes a difference between the employment status of Kanta and Kamal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal has irregular work schedules without any formal agreements or guarantees, unlike Kanta who receives benefits such as medical aid and pensions under her organised sector contract."},{"id":"b","text":"Organised sector workers are not entitled to leave or holidays, while those in the unorganised sector often have them but Kamal does not receive these due to his status of being a daily wage labourer without any formal agreements or guarantees."},{"id":"c","text":"Kanta's employment provides her with all forms of benefits including medical aid and pensions as she is employed under regulated working conditions, unlike Kamal who has no formal contracts or guarantees of employment in the unorganised sector."},{"id":"d","text":"Both employees receive fixed wages but Kamal lacks any form of leave or holidays, while Kanta's organised status ensures her job security and benefits such as medical aid and pensions."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kamal’s employment is characterized by$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Fixed working hours with guaranteed pay in contrast to the irregular nature of his work without any formal agreements or guarantees from his employer."},{"id":"b","text":"The unorganised sector typically employs more people and provides better benefits such as medical aid and pensions than the organised sector."},{"id":"c","text":"Kamal receives all forms of benefits including medical aid and pensions, unlike Kanta who is in an organised sector with a contract but does not receive these benefits due to his informal work status without any formal agreements or guarantees."},{"id":"d","text":"Both employees have similar job security but different working conditions; Kamal has no formal contracts or guarantees while Kanta works under regulated conditions and receives all forms of benefits including medical aid and pensions."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which statement accurately describes a difference between Kanta's employment status and that of Kamal?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Kamal’s work is characterized by irregular hours and lack of any formal agreements or guarantees, unlike the regulated conditions in the organised sector where Kanta has a contract with guaranteed benefits."},{"id":"b","text":"Organised sector workers are not entitled to leave or holidays, while those in the unorganised sector often have them but Kamal does not receive these due to his informal work status without any formal agreements or guarantees of employment."},{"id":"c","text":"Kamal receives all forms of benefits including medical aid and pensions as he is employed under a contract with an employer, unlike Kanta who has no formal agreement or guarantees of employment in the unorganised sector."},{"id":"d","text":"Both employees receive fixed wages but Kamal lacks any form of leave or holidays due to his informal work status without any formal agreements or guarantees of employment, while Kanta's organised status ensures her job security and benefits such as medical aid and pensions."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What criterion was used to classify economic activities into primary, secondary, and tertiary sectors?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Location-based"},{"id":"b","text":"Nature of activity"},{"id":"c","text":"Industry size"},{"id":"d","text":"Employee count"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which sector comprises the majority of rural households in India, according to the passage?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Organised sector"},{"id":"b","text":"Unorganised sector"},{"id":"c","text":"Both sectors equally"},{"id":"d","text":"Neither sector"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What strategy do farmers and artisans adopt to evade laws that protect workers in the organised sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Offering better wages"},{"id":"b","text":"Avoiding taxes and refusing to follow protective laws"},{"id":"c","text":"Seeking government support"},{"id":"d","text":"Joining unions"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The unorganised sector in rural areas primarily employs which type of workers?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Landless agricultural labourers"},{"id":"b","text":"Farmers and sharecroppers"},{"id":"c","text":"Mechanized farm operators"},{"id":"d","text":"Both B and C"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In the urban areas, which sector mainly comprises workers in small-scale industry?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Organised sector"},{"id":"b","text":"Unorganised sector"},{"id":"c","text":"Both sectors equally"},{"id":"d","text":"Neither sector"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a primary reason for the irregular and low-paid work that workers in the unorganised sector face?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Inadequate government support"},{"id":"b","text":"Limited access to formal education"},{"id":"c","text":"Unavailability of raw material and marketing facilities"},{"id":"d","text":"Low demand for products or services"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the unorganised sector in urban areas benefit from organised sector enterprises?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They receive more tax benefits"},{"id":"b","text":"They have easier access to raw materials and markets"},{"id":"c","text":"They are provided with better working conditions"},{"id":"d","text":"They get government subsidies for production"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following statements is true regarding workers from scheduled castes, tribes, and backward communities in the unorganised sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They have equal opportunities to secure organised sector jobs"},{"id":"b","text":"They are disproportionately represented in the unorganised sector due to social discrimination"},{"id":"c","text":"Their work is more secure than in other sectors"},{"id":"d","text":"They earn significantly higher wages than workers from other communities"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following best describes the process used to classify economic activities into organised and unorganised sectors?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"By employee count"},{"id":"b","text":"By industry type"},{"id":"c","text":"By sector size"},{"id":"d","text":"By activity nature"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What is a significant challenge that workers in the unorganised sector face after factory closures?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They have to start their own businesses"},{"id":"b","text":"They often resort to selling goods or odd jobs"},{"id":"c","text":"They need to migrate to urban areas"},{"id":"d","text":"They are forced into higher-paying sectors"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of the following is a reason for the slow expansion of employment opportunities in the organised sector compared to the unorganised sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"The organised sector offers more secure and regular work"},{"id":"b","text":"The unorganised sector provides better working conditions"},{"id":"c","text":"The organised sector does not offer enough jobs at competitive wages"},{"id":"d","text":"Both A and B are correct reasons"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'bd32357e-c161-4052-abdf-a267b5139644', '97c6c2d5-f510-4087-805b-00f051682dda', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What role do support facilities like seed delivery, agricultural inputs, credit, storage, marketing outlets play for workers in the unorganised sector?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They help increase their earnings significantly"},{"id":"b","text":"They make them more vulnerable to exploitation"},{"id":"c","text":"They reduce their need to enter the unorganised sector"},{"id":"d","text":"They decrease their demand for raw materials and output markets"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-420Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
